    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5828a84b_d2a42257",
        "filename": "libs/libavf/include/android/virtualization.h",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 314,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-12-26T09:56:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "vm is not a user-provided context object.\n\nSee AAudioStreamBuilder_setDataCallback as a counter example.\n\n```\nAAUDIO_API void AAudioStreamBuilder_setDataCallback(\n  AAudioStreamBuilder *_Nonnull builder,\n  AAudioStream_dataCallback _Nullable callback,\n  void *_Nullable userData\n)\n\naaudio_data_callback_result_t(* AAudioStream_dataCallback)(AAudioStream *_Nonnull stream, void *_Nullable userData, void *_Nonnull audioData, int32_t numFrames)\n```\n\nhere, the `stream` parameter corresponds to the `vm` parameter in our case. we don\u0027t have `userData`, because registering the same callback multiple times for the same VM object doesn\u0027t make sense and therefore we don\u0027t need to distinguish those.",
      "parentUuid": "47e518f8_a72a0afa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 314,
        "startChar": 44,
        "endLine": 314,
        "endChar": 55
      },
